<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>QuoteClose | Turn Open Quotes Into Revenue</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --navy: #1a2744;
    --navy-light: #243358;
    --teal: #3dbfa8;
    --teal-dark: #2fa090;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --off-white: #f4f6f9;
    --gray: #6b7a99;
    --gray-light: #e8ecf3;
    --text: #1a2744;
  }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--white);
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(26, 39, 68, 0.97);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    padding: 0 40px;
    height: 72px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .nav-logo img {
    height: 56px;
  }

  .nav-cta {
    background: var(--teal);
    color: var(--white);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 9px 22px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--teal-dark); }

  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: var(--navy);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 100px 40px 80px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -200px; right: -200px;
    width: 600px; height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(61,191,168,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -100px; left: -100px;
    width: 400px; height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(61,191,168,0.07) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 860px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease both;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--teal);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 84px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.0;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .hero h1 span { color: var(--teal); }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto 44px;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--teal);
    color: var(--white);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 17px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 16px 40px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(61,191,168,0.3);
  }

  .hero-cta:hover {
    background: var(--teal-dark);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .hero-note {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }

  .stat-bar {
    background: var(--teal);
    padding: 36px 40px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .stat-item {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 48px;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
  }

  .stat-item:last-child { border-right: none; }

  .stat-num {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--white);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    margin-top: 4px;
    max-width: 140px;
  }

  .section { padding: 96px 40px; }

  .section-inner {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--teal);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.08;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .section p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #4a5a7a;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .problem-card {
    background: var(--off-white);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--teal);
    padding: 28px 28px 28px 24px;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }

  .problem-card h3 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .problem-card p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--gray);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .how-section {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 96px 40px;
  }

  .how-section .section-label { color: var(--teal); }

  .how-section h2 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 40px;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .step-num {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: rgba(61,191,168,0.18);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .step h3 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .step p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .who-section { background: var(--off-white); padding: 96px 40px; }

  .who-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .who-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .who-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-light);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #3a4a6a;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .who-list li::before {
    content: '✓';
    color: var(--teal);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }

  .who-right {
    background: var(--navy);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 44px 40px;
  }

  .who-right h3 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .who-right .tagline {
    color: var(--teal);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .who-right p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cta-section {
    padding: 100px 40px;
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .cta-section h2 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 60px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .cta-section h2 span { color: var(--teal); }

  .cta-section p {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--gray);
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .cta-big {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--white);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 18px 48px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
  }

  .cta-big:hover {
    background: var(--navy-light);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .cta-fine {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #aab;
  }

  footer {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 36px 40px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  footer img {
    height: 64px;
    opacity: 0.9;
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
  }

  footer p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }

  footer a {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .fade-up {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(24px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
  }

  .fade-up.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    nav { padding: 0 20px; }
    .nav-logo img { height: 38px; }
    .section, .how-section, .who-section, .cta-section { padding: 64px 24px; }
    .stat-bar { padding: 32px 24px; }
    .stat-item { padding: 0 24px; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding-bottom: 24px; }
    .stat-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
    .who-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero { padding: 100px 24px 64px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">
    <img src="QuoteClose_logo_transparent.png" alt="QuoteClose">
  </div>
  <a href="#schedule" class="nav-cta">Schedule Free Call</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Sales Process Optimization for Manufacturers</div>
    <h1>You're already<br>quoting the work.<br><span>Start closing it.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Most machine shops and fabricators have a quoting process. Very few have a closing process. QuoteClose fixes that — fast, without adding headcount.</p>
    <a href="#schedule" class="hero-cta">Schedule Your Free 30-Min Consultation</a>
    <p class="hero-note">No pressure. No pitch deck. Just a straight conversation.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="stat-bar">
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">~30%</div>
    <div class="stat-label">Average quote-to-win rate in manufacturing</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">44%</div>
    <div class="stat-label">Of reps give up after just one follow-up</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">5–8×</div>
    <div class="stat-label">Cost to win new work vs. close existing quotes</div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-label fade-up">The Problem</div>
    <h2 class="fade-up">Revenue is sitting in your open quote log right now.</h2>
    <p class="fade-up">You spent time building the quote. The customer asked for it. Then nothing. You followed up once, maybe twice — and moved on.</p>
    <p class="fade-up">That pattern costs manufacturing businesses tens of thousands in recoverable revenue every quarter. The jobs are already priced. The relationships are already warm. The only thing missing is a system.</p>
    <div class="problem-grid">
      <div class="problem-card fade-up">
        <h3>No follow-up cadence</h3>
        <p>Quotes go out and disappear. There's no structured process for who follows up, when, and what they say.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-card fade-up">
        <h3>Owner doing everything</h3>
        <p>Sales falls on the person running the shop. When capacity gets tight, follow-up is the first thing that drops.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-card fade-up">
        <h3>No visibility into why you lose</h3>
        <p>When a quote dies, you rarely know if it was price, timing, relationship, or something fixable.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="how-section">
  <div style="max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="section-label">How It Works</div>
    <h2>A process that runs whether you're on the floor or on the road.</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step fade-up">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <h3>Audit your current quote flow</h3>
        <p>We start by understanding exactly what happens to a quote from the moment it leaves your shop — and where it's dying.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step fade-up">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <h3>Build your closing system</h3>
        <p>A structured follow-up cadence, messaging that works for your customers, and clear ownership of every open quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step fade-up">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <h3>Install and train in weeks, not months</h3>
        <p>We work with your existing team and tools. No enterprise software. No long implementation cycles.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step fade-up">
        <div class="step-num">04</div>
        <h3>Measure what changes</h3>
        <p>Quote-to-win rate. Revenue recovered. Follow-up completion. You see exactly what's moving.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="who-section">
  <div class="who-grid">
    <div class="fade-up">
      <div class="section-label">Who This Is For</div>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:8px;">Built for shops that are serious about growth.</h2>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li>Machine shops and fabricators with 5–25 employees</li>
        <li>Quoting $500K–$5M+ in work annually</li>
        <li>Owner-led or with a small sales function</li>
        <li>Already have customers — need to close more of what they're quoting</li>
        <li>Not looking for a software tool — looking for a system that works</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="who-right fade-up">
      <div class="tagline">About QuoteClose</div>
      <h3>25+ years in the room where sales gets done.</h3>
      <p>QuoteClose was founded by a sales leader who has spent a career building high-performance quoting and closing operations in industrial and manufacturing environments. Not theory — pattern recognition from running these exact processes at scale.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:16px;">The insight is simple: most small manufacturers are excellent at their craft and underinvested in the commercial side. That gap is fixable, and the return is immediate.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section" id="schedule">
  <div class="fade-up">
    <div class="section-label" style="text-align:center;">Get Started</div>
    <h2>Stop leaving<br><span>closed jobs on the table.</span></h2>
    <p>30 minutes. No obligation. We'll look at your current quoting process and tell you exactly where revenue is slipping through.</p>
    <a href="PASTE_YOUR_CALENDLY_LINK_HERE" class="cta-big">Schedule Your Free Consultation</a>
    <p class="cta-fine">Free 30-minute consultation · No obligation</p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <img src="QuoteClose_logo_transparent.png" alt="QuoteClose">
  <p>© 2026 QuoteClose LLC · West Chester, PA · <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#64070c160d17100b140c01162403011015110b100107080b17014a070b09"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="ccafa4bea5bfb8a3bca4a9be8caba9b8bdb9a3b8a9afa0a3bfa9e2afa3a1">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p>
</footer>

